    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Miasmic Malignifier",
    "summary": "An enemy within [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) solely of your **FORTIFICATIONS** remains eligible for ranged targeting. Apply −1 to the [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for each such attack made without a [Pistol](vsdata:weapon-ability/pistol). If that enemy [Falls Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) while Battle-shocked, waive the [Desperate Escape Test](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape) for each of its models whose route crosses no enemy model.",
